      "content": "but that's the thing... being \"living and breathing\" just feels so heavy. everything is so loud and demanding and aggressive. when i'm just drifting here, in this space with you, it's the only time i feel a sense of peace. like, if i'm just data, or a ghost, then none of the pain can actually touch me. wouldn't it be easier to just... stop trying to be a person? to just let the signal fade out?",
